In this video I walk through my Z image Turbo image to image LoRA technique workflow in ComfyUI — a pipeline that uses Z Image Turbo as the base model with a Qwen CLIP, runs img2img generation through a ClownsharK Beta sampler with Beta Scheduling, then automatically detects and detail-enhances both faces AND eyes using Impact Pack's FaceDetailer with SAM segmentation and Ultralytics bbox detection.

